  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.repositories.mongodb.models.QuoteDetails\": {\n        \"summary\": \"MongoDB document entity class representing quote details stored in the 'quotes' collection. Serves as a persistence layer model that bridges between the database and the domain model (Quote class). Contains fields for quote identification (quoteId), dealer and customer information (dealerName, customerName, city, state, postalCode), financial details (totalCost, discount), quote items array, and validity period (validUntil). The quoteId and dealerName fields are indexed for efficient querying. Provides bidirectional conversion capabilities: a constructor that accepts a Quote domain model to create a QuoteDetails instance (converting List to array for quoteItems), and a toQuote() method that converts the database model back to a Quote domain model (converting array back to List). Uses Spring Data MongoDB annotations (@Document, @Id, @Indexed) for persistence configuration.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/mongodb/models/QuoteDetails.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
